// The smoothing the classic oscillators are built on, drawn on its own: seeded
// with the simple mean of its first window and then carrying the previous value
// forward with a weight of one over the length.
//
// Exercises: the seeding rule the rest of this half of the gate depends on, at
// a length short enough that the seed still shows and long enough that the
// recurrence does.

version 1

study("Smoothed average", overlay = true, precision = 4)

len = input(7, "Length", min = 1, max = 1000)

plot(rma(close, len), "Smoothed", purple, width = 2)
